<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hans"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><meta name="editor-session" content="EDITOR_SESSION_TOKEN"><title>Canberra Waterproof 本地内容后台</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/__editor/editor.css"></head><body>
<header class="editorTop"><div><strong>Canberra Waterproof 内容编辑</strong><span>MEL ONE · 本地草稿，不会自动上线</span></div><div class="topActions"><span id="saveState" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在连接…</span><button id="reload" type="button">重新载入</button><button id="historyButton" type="button">历史版本</button><button id="saveButton" type="button" class="primary" disabled>保存中文草稿</button></div></header>
<p id="error" role="alert" hidden></p>
<main class="workspace"><aside class="directory"><h1>内容目录</h1><label for="search">搜索页面</label><div class="search"><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="标题或网址"><button id="clear" type="button" aria-label="清空页面搜索" hidden>×</button></div><label for="group">页面类型</label><select id="group"><option value="all">全部页面</option><option value="main">首页及公共页面</option><option value="services">服务</option><option value="guides">深度指南</option><option value="waterproofing">服务地区</option><option value="industry-news">行业文章</option><option value="case-studies">施工案例</option></select><p id="count" class="muted" role="status"></p><nav id="pageList" aria-label="选择编辑页面"></nav></aside>
<section class="canvas" aria-label="页面预览"><div class="canvasToolbar"><div><strong id="pageTitle">正在读取页面</strong><span id="pagePath"></span></div><div class="modes"><button id="desktop" type="button" aria-pressed="true">电脑</button><button id="mobile" type="button" aria-pressed="false">手机</button><button id="chinese" type="button" aria-pressed="true">中文</button><button id="english" type="button" aria-pressed="false">English</button><a id="openPreview" href="/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">单独预览 ↗</a></div></div><p class="hint">点击整段文字在右侧修改；含链接的段落可以直接编辑文字，原链接保留。预览不发送询盘。</p><div id="frameViewport"><iframe id="preview" title="当前页面预览" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin"></iframe></div></section>
<aside class="inspector"><span class="eyebrow">中文编辑 / 英文对照</span><h2 id="fieldHeading">选择一段文字</h2><p id="scope" class="muted">点选页面文字，或从列表选择。</p><label for="field">本页文字</label><select id="field" disabled><option>正在读取…</option></select><p id="coverage" class="muted"></p>
<form id="copyForm" novalidate hidden><label id="copyLabel" for="plainCopy">中文草稿</label><div id="richCopy" class="richCopy" contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-labelledby="copyLabel" aria-describedby="copyHelp copyError" hidden></div><textarea id="plainCopy" rows="8" style="resize:none" aria-describedby="copyHelp copyError"></textarea><p id="copyError" class="errorText" role="status"></p><p id="copyHelp" class="muted">可修改完整段落。粘贴采用纯文本；保留原有链接，不修改链接目标。</p><label for="englishCopy">当前英文（只读）</label><textarea id="englishCopy" rows="7" readonly style="resize:none"></textarea></form>
<div class="workflow"><h3>修改后的下一步</h3><p>保存中文草稿后，通知助手“同步英文并应用本地”。核对中英文后，再另行确认部署。</p><p id="pending" role="status"></p><small>页眉、页脚和业务资料文字也可记录草稿。电话目标、邮箱链接、地址、资质等应用前需全站核对，后台不会隐式更改。</small></div></aside></main>
<dialog id="navigationDialog" aria-labelledby="navigationTitle"><h2 id="navigationTitle">当前修改尚未保存</h2><p>保存后再继续，或放弃本次未保存修改。已保存草稿不受影响。</p><div class="actions"><button id="cancelNav" type="button" autofocus>继续编辑</button><button id="discardNav" type="button">放弃本次修改</button><button id="saveNav" type="button" class="primary">保存并继续</button></div></dialog>
<dialog id="historyDialog" aria-labelledby="historyTitle"><h2 id="historyTitle">历史版本</h2><p>恢复生成新版本，不删除原历史。</p><div id="historyList"></div><p id="historyStatus" role="status"></p><button id="closeHistory" type="button">关闭</button></dialog>
<dialog id="restoreDialog" aria-labelledby="restoreTitle"><h2 id="restoreTitle">恢复所选历史版本？</h2><p>当前已保存内容仍保留在历史中，恢复只影响本页本地草稿。</p><div class="actions"><button id="cancelRestore" type="button" autofocus>取消</button><button id="confirmRestore" type="button" class="primary">恢复为新版本</button></div></dialog>
<script type="module" src="/__editor/editor.js"></script></body></html>
